General Information
===================

medit is a lightweight programmer's text editor.

medit is free software, released under the GNU Lesser General Public
License version 2.1 or later.  See the COPYING file in this distribution
for the full text.

See README.md for the feature list, screenshots and build instructions,
and INSTALL for dependencies and build options.

The project page is:
    https://github.com/fangq/medit


Installation
============

See the INSTALL file in this distribution.


Bug reports and contact
=======================

Report bugs and file feature requests at
    https://github.com/fangq/medit/issues


Sources
=======

medit sources are tracked with git:

    git clone https://github.com/fangq/medit.git


History
=======

medit was written by Yevgen Muntyan between 2004 and 2010, and was
developed at mooedit.sourceforge.net and medit.bitbucket.org.  This
repository is a fork that continues it; the original project is no
longer maintained, and its old bug tracker and contact addresses should
not be used for issues with this version.
